{"id":"en_destined-hearts-misadventures-of-love-and-secrets","title":"Destined Hearts Misadventures of Love and Secrets","titleEn":"Destined Hearts Misadventures of Love and Secrets","description":"Jessie Smith, an orphan, has an unexpected one-night encounter with her employer, Tane Lee. Fearing the consequences, she plans to walk away, but a resume she forgets to take causes Tane to believe he slept with Shell Lane, Jessie's closest friend, and the two start dating. Working as Tane's secretary, Jessie does her best to keep her distance, yet her feelings for him grow anyway. After learning she is pregnant, she resolves to tell him the truth, only to discover that his mysterious girlfriend is none other than Shell. Caught in an impossible position, Jessie decides to step back and let them be together. In time, Tane uncovers what really happened, and the pair begin a push-and-pull dynamic that carries them from hostility to love, ending with the star-crossed couple finally united. Vie","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/destined-hearts-misadventures-of-love-and-secrets/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/destined-hearts-misadventures-of-love-and-secrets/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["One Night Stand","Sweet","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_destined-hearts-misadventures-of-love-and-secrets_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_destined-hearts-misadventures-of-love-and-secrets_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dkyt4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downlo